    "title": "Zombie Outpost:Deadly",
    "description": "During the apocalypse, a zombie virus spread worldwide. Humans built defensive lines to survive. As a human, build your fortress urgently.\r\nIn 'Zombie Outpost: Deadly', you're not alone facing the disaster. High-tech props in the game help you overcome challenges, but you must stay active, upgrade your tech, and get new equipment. It's all essential in this world.\r\nWhen you are about to face battle, you will face\u2014\u2014\r\n\ud83e\udddfWave after wave of zombie waves\r\n\ud83c\udccfDifficult choices over and over again\r\n\ud83d\udd25Combine various skills to create a powerful synergy\r\n\ud83d\udc8eObtain various level drops\r\nOf course, you don't have to experience intense battles every moment. Moderate relaxation activities and a balance between work and rest will make you stronger.\r\nIn your spare time, you can\u2014\u2014\r\n\ud83e\uddd4Select distinct and formidable characters\r\n\ud83d\udfe2Equip your weapon with mighty gemstones that pack a punch\r\n\u26f0\ufe0fDigging for treasure beneath the mine\r\n\ud83d\udc67Go restaurant and dine with beauty\r\n'Zombie Outpost: Deadly' awaits! Zombies are breaking through\u2014download now to live your legendary tale without hesitation.",
